Ported files (TypeScript translations of msfa's C++, modified as noted in each file's header):
    src/engine/tables.ts       from sin.cc, exp2.cc, freqlut.cc
    src/engine/env.ts          from env.cc (sample-rate scaling added)
    src/engine/pitchenv.ts     from pitchenv.cc
    src/engine/lfo.ts          from lfo.cc
    src/engine/note.ts         from dx7note.cc, fm_core.cc, fm_op_kernel.cc (routing, chained feedback,
                               amplitude modulation, transpose, OSC KEY SYNC and operator on/off are new)
    src/engine/calibration.ts  tables from env.cc, dx7note.cc, pitchenv.cc, lfo.cc, synth_unit.cc (marked PORTED)

test/algorithms.test.ts includes msfa's algorithm routing table (fm_core.cc) as test data.
